# Vulnerabilities accepted for a limited time. One ID per line, with a
# comment above it: why it is accepted, who decided, and the date to review.
# Example:
# # glibc in the base image; no fixed Debian package yet; reviewed by @owner; review by 2026-12-01
# CVE-2026-00000
#
# Only the YYYY-MM-DD date in that comment line is read (by
# tests/test_trivyignore.py, which fails once it is in the past). Trivy's own
# inline "exp:YYYY-MM-DD" suffix on the identifier line itself is not used
# here and has no effect on this repository's checks.
